## Conventions

- Portrait only
- Minimize scope per change; match existing file layout
- Run `npm run typecheck` after TS changes
- **i18n** — all user-visible strings in `src/i18n/locales/`; no new hard-coded UI copy in components
- Native module / `android/` changes → new EAS build; JS-only → EAS Update eligible (i18n is JS-only → OTA-eligible)
- No `CLAUDE.md` / `.claude/` — Cursor rules only (this file)
